xxxxxcx+xcxxxxx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xcmmmc...cmmccx
xx...........xx
@+...........+@
xx...........xx
xcmmmc...cmmmcx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xxwwwm...mwwwxx
xxxxxcx+xcxxxxx
xxxxxxx@xxxxxxx
ENDMAP
